<title>USA: Insilco extends buy back expiration date.</title>
<headline>Insilco extends buy back expiration date.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Insilco Corp said it extended the expiration date of its offer to buy back up to 2,857,142 shares of its common stock at $38.50 per share.</p>
<p>The Company said the tender offer, which it started on July 11, was extended to 5:00 p.m., New York City time, August 12.</p>
<p>As of August 7, about 2,608,020 shares had been tendered and not withdrawn under the tender offer, the company said.</p>
